    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.022
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - <SFX_liezel_wondering>Yes, I believe that would be the best course of action.
      If it turns out to be nothing of note, then we can free the Disidensiya from
      suspicion.
    - <SFX_liezel_concerned>I want to believe that the Disidensiya is not hiding
      anything from me, but if I want to get to the bottom of this, I ought to be
      ready to learn anything.
    - Please continue investigating the area. I will head back and see if I can uncover
      more information.
