  dialogue:
    character: {fileID: -1077248894956463413, guid: 4c74d9b45011c0a4cb33179b186c1f73, type: 3}
    character2: {fileID: -1293936391025474623, guid: 4551b9b0ca3f36b498cfea661e9dc542, type: 3}
    name: Anika
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3eb1024c55ce8430ba259a61060f08e3, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - "I swear, people have forgotten the significance of the great Se\xF1or Rommel\u2019s
      finest words...\r"
    - "If there was one ideology that marks the great Se\xF1or Rommel, it is the
      fact that he clings to whatever he thinks is right. No excuses or detours.
      Straight towards his goals.\r"
    - If it was for the future of Giyala that he believed, he would have dropped
      everything. <b>No matter the price.</b>
